## BerriesApi

### List berry firmness
## List berry firmness
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/berry-firmness/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get berry by firmness
## Get berry by firmness
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/berry-firmness/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### List berry flavors
## List berry flavors
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/berry-flavor/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get berries by flavor
## Get berries by flavor
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/berry-flavor/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### List berries
## List berries
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/berry/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get a berry
## Get a berry
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/berry/{{id}}/
